# Openings (docs/DIALOGUE.md, "Who talks"; docs/DESIGN.md, "Openings"): whoever's outside the door you
# come out of. Nobody is new: everyone has been trapped since the seal, and they never say "you're new".
# The step's ask and the story's beats are the built lines (RZ_OpeningText); these add their greeting,
# once, while the first step runs, and a few things to ask on the way. Character flags: opening.first
# 1 while the first step runs; opening.why why today (1 the hiding place, 2 your group gone, 3 the fever
# broke); opening.who who's outside (1 someone from before, by your background; 2 a stranger; 3 a
# wanderer who met an earlier life of yours); opening.earlier what that wanderer remembers (1 a
# kindness, 2 a wrong, 3 only the face); opening.step the step under way (1-3; 4 once it's over);
# opening.end the faction it ends with (1 the Haven, 2 Bastion, 3 the Red Hand, 4 Halcyon).
# Voice: plain, a neighbour's.

conv opening.greet.stranger
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=2
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say? cflag:opening.why=2 :: "Your lot went out three mornings ago, four of them, with a map. I watched from my window. I've been watching it since."
  say? cflag:opening.why=3 :: "That was my chalk on your door. I heard you through it for three nights. Then I didn't, and I waited anyway."
  say "I heard the bolt go. Don't mind me. I don't know you, but nobody should come out of a door on their own."

conv opening.greet.earlier
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=3
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say? cflag:opening.earlier=2 :: "You look like someone I knew. Someone I'd cross the road from. Different face, though. Different chance."
  say? cflag:opening.earlier=1 :: "You look like someone I knew. They did me a kindness on the road, once. Funny. You stand the way they did."
  say "You look like someone I knew. Same walk. I don't suppose you'd remember a face from the road."

conv opening.greet.nurse
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=1 & bg:nurse
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say "Christ. It's you. You did my boy's stitches in May. He still shows people the scar, when there's people to show."

conv opening.greet.doctor
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=1 & bg:doctor
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say "Doctor. I'd know that cough through a wall. Ward three's gone, you know. All of it. We're what's left of the rota."

conv opening.greet.mechanic
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=1 & bg:mechanic
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say "It's you. You fixed my van twice and charged me once. I always meant to pay the other one."

conv opening.greet.hunter
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=1 & bg:hunter
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say "Thought that was you. Nobody else walks that quiet. My top field's yours now, if anyone still wants fields."

conv opening.greet.police
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=1 & bg:police
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say "Officer. You bought one apple every morning and never ate it. I used to wonder about that. I still do."

conv opening.greet.excon
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=1 & bg:excon
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say "Look at you. Out of one box and straight into another. Some of us have a gift for it."

conv opening.greet.labtech
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=1 & bg:labtech
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say "You're alive. They read your name out at the lab gate, with the missing. They still want hands like yours."

conv opening.greet.radioham
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=1 & bg:radioham
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say "I know that voice. Half past one, the night band. You always signed off with the weather."

conv opening.greet.unemployed
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=1 & bg:unemployed
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say "You're alive. Good. Don't worry about the money. Money's a joke now, and not a good one."

conv opening.greet.soldier
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=1 & bg:soldier
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say "Sarge? It's me. The line went and I never made it back to it. Looks like you didn't either."

conv opening.greet.raider
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=1 & bg:raider
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say "You. You took my watch in March. Keep it. I want something else from you, and it isn't what you think."

conv opening.greet.elder
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=1 & bg:elder
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say "It's you. The children kept asking if you'd gone. I kept saying no. I'm glad I wasn't lying to them."

conv opening.greet.drifter
for opening
when cflag:opening.first=1 & cflag:opening.who=1 & bg:drifter
greet
prio quest
once
voice plain

node start
  say "I know you. Everyone knows you a bit, don't they. Never mind from where. You're alive, that's the thing."

conv opening.who_else
for opening
when cflag:opening.step>=1 & cflag:opening.step<=3
topic "Ask who else made it."
prio world
once
voice plain

node start
  say "Fewer than you'd hope. More than you'd think. Most are behind doors, same as you were."
  say "The ones who went for the roads in the first week, I don't count them any more. It's easier."
  > @road "What happened on the roads?" -> road
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node road
  say "Concrete where the bridges were. Drones over the fields. A loudspeaker that knows your name before you've said it."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

conv opening.who_holds
for opening
when cflag:opening.step>=2 & cflag:opening.step<=3
topic "Ask who's in charge now."
prio world
once
voice plain

node start
  say "Depends where you stand. The soldiers count you. The red-hand lot charge you. The lab people want your blood, politely."
  say "And the safehouses feed you if you work. That's the whole government now. Pick one before one picks you."
  > @lab "The lab people?" -> lab
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node lab
  say "Halcyon. White coats in a school, in masks. They say there's a cure in the specials, if enough of them get cut open."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

conv opening.where_now
for opening
when cflag:opening.step=3
topic "Ask where they'll go now."
prio flavour
once
voice plain

node start
  say? cflag:opening.end=3 :: "Not where you're going. They'd have the coat off my back before I'd said hello. I'll find a door."
  say "Behind you, at a distance. I'm slower than I look, and I look slow. Don't wait for me."
  > @come "Come with me." -> come
  > @fine "Mind how you go." -> hub

node come
  say "I will. Just not at your pace. Go on. If I'm not there by dark, I found somewhere better."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub
